# env zero: The Cloud Governance Platform | 10x Faster Infra

env zero enables enterprises to deliver infrastructure 10x faster without losing control. Trusted by PayPal, Broadcom, and Paramount for standardized, self-service workflows.

## Key Features and Offerings

### Governance and Risk Management
- [Cloud Governance & Risk Management](https://www.env0.com/solutions/cloud-governance-and-risk-management): This section outlines how env zero helps organizations manage cloud governance and mitigate risks associated with cloud infrastructure.

### Deployment and Automation
- [Automate the Full Deployment Lifecycle](https://www.env0.com/solutions/automate-the-full-deployment-lifecycle): A comprehensive guide on automating the entire deployment process, enhancing efficiency and reducing manual errors.
- [10xfaster deployment cycles](https://www.env0.com/solutions/drift-management): Highlights the platform's capability to significantly accelerate deployment cycles, achieving tenfold improvements.
- [AI-assisted logic](https://docs.env0.com/docs/cloud-compass): Discusses the integration of AI to enhance deployment workflows and decision-making processes.

### Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
- [IaC Onboarding & Codification](https://www.env0.com/solutions/iac-onboarding-codification): Details the onboarding process for Infrastructure as Code, including best practices for codification.
- [Infrastructure as Code guardrails](https://docs.env0.com/docs/policies?__hstc=17958374.438560ca4e31356ddb65e304d5b67b18.1697695625780.1699353413650.1700744742973.31&__hssc=17958374.2.1700744742973&__hsfp=2690663212): Explains the guardrails provided by env zero to ensure compliance and security in IaC practices.
- [Policy as Code guardrails](https://docs.env0.com/docs/approval-policies): Describes how policy as code can be implemented to enforce governance and compliance.

### Cost Management
- [Cost Governance and FinOps Enablement](https://www.env0.com/solutions/cost-governance-and-finops-enablement): This section focuses on financial governance and operational efficiency in managing cloud costs.
- [cost impact](https://docs.env0.com/docs/cost-monitoring?_gl=1*15zy97q*_ga*MzQzMjE4NzQ4LjE2Nzc2OTQ3MDk.*_ga_VYZFC0GDCG*MTY4MzE0MDA1MS43MC4xLjE2ODMxNDA1MDQuMjIuMC4w#cost-estimation): Analyzes the financial implications of cloud infrastructure decisions and deployments.
- [actual costs](https://docs.env0.com/docs/cost-monitoring?_gl=1*15zy97q*_ga*MzQzMjE4NzQ4LjE2Nzc2OTQ3MDk.*_ga_VYZFC0GDCG*MTY4MzE0MDA1MS43MC4xLjE2ODMxNDA1MDQuMjIuMC4w#actual-cost): Provides insights into the real costs associated with cloud operations and how to manage them effectively.

### Self-Service and Standardization
- [Standardized Workflows Across Teams & Departments](https://www.env0.com/solutions/standardized-workflows-across-teams-and-departments): Discusses the importance of standardized workflows to enhance collaboration and efficiency across different teams.
- [DevX Self-Service with Guardrails](https://www.env0.com/solutions/devx-self-service-with-guardrails): Explains how developers can utilize self-service capabilities while adhering to governance standards.

### Integrations and Compatibility
- [Terraformenv0 and Terraform, better together](https://www.env0.com/resources/terraform): Highlights the synergy between env zero and Terraform, enhancing infrastructure management.
- [env zero Terraform Provider](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/env0/env0/latest): Details the Terraform provider for env zero, enabling seamless integration with existing Terraform workflows.

